  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Mirror willows are ordinary plants, about the size of ordinary willow trees, but their leaves are like pieces of mirrors. These leaves are the food of Beggar Moth. Fang Yuan purchases a batch of mirror willows from Immortal Crane Sect during the rockmen transactions and plants them in Hu Immortal blessed land. He picks one of them for Mo Yao’s will, who says the death energy of his dead immortal aperture will corrode it into a dead tree in under three days.",
